OL,3,GNEWSANew delay for food waste bin
OL,4,Acollections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of households face a longer
OL,7,Fwait for weekly food waste collections
OL,8,Fbecause of a shortage of bin lorry
OL,9,Fdrivers.
OL,11,FSouth Norfolk Council had planned to
OL,12,Fsend out new caddies and 23-litre bins
OL,13,Fto 40,000 more households ahead of the
OL,14,Fstart of the next phase of the service
OL,15,Fwhich was due to begin this month.
OL,17,FHowever, the rollout, which is taking
OL,18,Fplace in two phases, has now been
OL,19,Fpushed back until November to give the
OL,20,Flocal authority more time to recruit
OL,21,Fand train drivers.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
